  "answer_markdown": "For the Mistral API operation `DELETE /v1/models/{model_id}`, the required parameter is `model_id` (string, required, in path). It represents the ID of the model to be deleted.\n\n**cURL Example:**\n```bash\ncurl --location --request DELETE 'https://api.mistral.ai/v1/models/ft:classifier:ministral-3b-latest:XXX:20250401:XXX' \\\n     --header 'Accept: application/json' \\\n     --header \"Authorization: Bearer $MISTRAL_API_KEY\"\n```\n\nThis operation is used to delete a fine-tuned model when it is no longer needed.\n\n[3]",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 3,
      "quote": "model_id (string, required, in path) — The ID of the model to delete."
    }
  ],
  "insufficient_evidence": false
}

