  "answer_markdown": "To investigate who deleted conversations by querying audit logs programmatically:\n\n1. **Activity and Event Type**:\n   - The relevant event type is `le_chat.conversation.deleted` [3].\n\n2. **Query Parameters to Narrow Results**:\n   - Use the `actor_type` filter to include only logs where the actor is a human user (`HUMAN`) [2] or [4].\n   - Use the `actor_user_uuid` parameter to filter logs by the UUID of the specific human user who performed the action [2] or [4].\n\n3. **Default Entries per Request**:\n   - By default, the API returns a maximum of **20 entries per request** [2] or [4].\n\n### Example API Request:\n```\nGET /v1/admin/audit-logs?event_type=le_chat.conversation.deleted&actor_type=HUMAN&actor_user_uuid=<USER_UUID>\n```\n\n```json",
